sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Main as Main Brain
    participant Notes as CT Basic Memory
    participant LM as Local coding model
    participant Check as Syntax validator
    User->>Main: Prompt and optional checkpoint ID
    opt Memory enabled
        Main->>Notes: Search matching notes
        Notes-->>Main: Return matching text
    end
    Main->>LM: Generate from selected model
    LM-->>Main: Return generated answer
    opt Check requested and Python block available
        Main->>Check: Compile extracted block
        Check-->>Main: Return diagnostics
    end
    Main-->>User: Answer, source and status
